OL,3,GNEWSAReception pupils face losing free
OL,4,Aschool transport
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome children in Cheshire may no longer
OL,7,Freceive free transport to school, under
OL,8,Fnew plans by the council.
OL,10,FUnder current rules, four-year-olds
OL,11,Fgoing to reception in Cheshire East
OL,12,Fschools receive free travel if they are
OL,13,Feligible - despite the power being
OL,14,Fdiscretionary.
OL,16,FCheshire East's cabinet has agreed to
OL,17,Flaunch a public consultation on
OL,18,Fremoving the support, as well as some
OL,19,Fchanges to how distances to schools are
OL,20,Fmeasured.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
